      "message": "This is frontend code so it doesn\u0027t seem like the right place for this R001 check. Different backends handle this differently (some don\u0027t have to swizzle at all for depth/stencil, others have to choose between R001 and G001). Right now, I don\u0027t think the *frontend\u0027s* default swizzle for depth/stencil textures is R001, which means this would usually return true. (This just wouldn\u0027t cause a correctness bug, it just enables swizzle unnecessarily.)\n\nIf the intent of `UsesNonDefaultSwizzle` is just for the backend to determine whether to enable swizzling or not, I don\u0027t think it should be here at all - it should be done on a per-backend basis to avoid logic errors.",
